    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Fork, phase 1 (769c44f0)",
      "items": [
        "Each flag is resolved once by ww_kokkos_flag; WW_KOKKOS_<PART>=1 on, unset follows WW_KOKKOS_ALL, default off",
        "Phase 1 copies one sea point in, runs the kernel, copies it out",
        "Flag off runs the same Fortran call as NOAA, in the same executable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Resident (--kokkos resident)",
      "items": [
        "Preset SRCE,XYP3,KTP3,OUTG,IOPE,UPDV (scripts/ww3-gpu.sh:167)",
        "VA stays on the device; host readers call W3KOKKOS_VA_HOST_READ first",
        "XYP3, KTP3, OUTG, IOPE, UPDV are opt-in and not regtested"
